{
  "$schema": "../../specs/erc7730-v2.schema.json",
  "$comment": "Chain IDs use enums: needs an Ethereum app that accepts enums on non-uint8 fields (rejected since app-ethereum-dev@2c90ee9). Enums cover destinations seen in traffic only; unlisted IDs are blind. destAddr/tokenOut are bytes32 (possibly non-EVM), so shown raw. Amounts in Mayan 8-decimal units, so shown raw.",
